      "text": "Cole Hutson was credited with the secondary assist on Leonard's goal, extending his point and assist streaks to three games (1g-3a–4p). Hutson has registered eight points (3g, 5a) in his last seven games and now has 13 points (5g, 8a) in 18 games this season.",
